{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vastophobia is a new game about exploring liminal and strange space's , focusing on atmosphere and mild threats (no jump scares here). Find out why you are here. where is your family. make your way through varied and disturbing environments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vastophobia's first chapter is around an hour's playtime. with 5 chapters planned, each chapter will be around one hour long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras/78c8892515200554515063eb90a06302.avif?t=1764619116\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras_big/78c8892515200554515063eb90a06302.avif?t=1764619116 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools to evade enemies. no jump scares. you will always be able to see or hear the threats first</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras/00daf410290785f144035bb1190bac06.avif?t=1764619116\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras_big/00daf410290785f144035bb1190bac06.avif?t=1764619116 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Story , follow how you arrived here. what happened to you and where is your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras/772f5dc37393cbc2f45626f3f60741f6.avif?t=1764619116\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras_big/772f5dc37393cbc2f45626f3f60741f6.avif?t=1764619116 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vastophbia is an early access game which focus's on atmosphere and soundscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >venture into the strange world of the In-Between and try to return to your family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will release with the first of Five Chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music By\u00a0Scott Buckley - Composer</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558470?t=1764619116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/bf63c12db9d1f9c1ca2e019ec550a4a4705adf37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764619116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/aef101a5793f3261b61007397c79a230b7da34ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764619116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/aef101a5793f3261b61007397c79a230b7da34ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764619116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood splatters on ground"},"demos":[{"appid":3558780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vastophobia is a new game about exploring liminal and strange space's , focusing on atmosphere and mild threats (no jump scares here). Find out why you are here. where is your family. make your way through varied and disturbing environments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vastophobia's first chapter is around an hour's playtime. with 5 chapters planned, each chapter will be around one hour long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras/78c8892515200554515063eb90a06302.avif?t=1764619116\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558470/extras_big/78c88